WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:05.300
From deep... in my heart, it's welling up...

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.720
But... But it isn't...

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.430
Yeah, we're... we're still okay.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.510
We've held him back so... many times before.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.930
Leo said

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.950
Z-ARC was split by Ray

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.910
and reincarnated into each 
of the four dimensions.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.110
But Z-ARC is now trying to reintegrate himself.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:37.800
He was the ultimate duelist. 
The duelist who reigned over all others.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.080
To restore that part of himself...

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.820
In that case...

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.230
Yuya!

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:00.710
Did Z-ARC choose me to 
revive him as a duelist?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:09.150
He made me raise his double and 
teach him dueling from scratch

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.850
to hasten his reawakening?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.110
If that's true,

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.560
I may have aided a devil's revival, 
without even realizing it.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.990
This is the end!

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.700
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.980
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.280
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.980
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:18.940
Parts of the Supreme King

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:28.120
I activate the Pendulum Effect 
of the right Spirit Reactor!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:34.750
When monsters are on the field with 
Earth, Water, Fire, or Wind Attributes,

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:38.330
I can negate a monster's destruction on my field.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.940
Gust King Alexander is Wind.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.020
Wave King Caesar is Water.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.270
Thus, Pendulum Governor is not destroyed!

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.370
My monsters protected him?

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:52.680
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:56.850
Yuya...

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.400
I have no time.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:04.690
Z-ARC truly is attempting to revive.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:07.230
What are ARC-V's present energy values?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.690
They'll reach 20% shortly.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:13.120
Too slow! Increase the rate of injection!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:17.420
We must activate ARC-V before Z-ARC revives.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.670
Z-ARC is nothing!

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.050
That devil's revival means nothing.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:22.790
The way that you use

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:26.520
the people who were turned into 
cards like fuel for a furnace...

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.480
What you're doing is much closer 
to the work of a devil!

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.450
I won't allow you to unite the dimensions.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:37.000
I will protect the four dimensions' peace!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.620
My turn!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.380
I tribute D/D/D Gust King Alexander

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.100
and D/D/D Wave King Caesar,

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.330
to Tribute Summon D/D/D Doom King Armageddon!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:58.340
His Synchro Monster...

00:04:58.340 --> 00:04:59.940
And his Xyz Monster...

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.850
He tributed them, so...

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:05.530
He abandoned Dark Contract 
with Exclusivity's effect,

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.390
just to summon a high-level monster.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:13.260
But now the Wind and Water 
Attribute monsters are gone,

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:18.980
negating Spirit Reactor's Pendulum Effect, 
which protects the monsters on Leo's field.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:23.910
Doom King Armageddon is a 
Level 8 Pendulum Monster.

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:27.200
He's sealed all the effects that 
protect Pendulum Governor.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:27.910
Yes.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:32.110
Meaning that it can now be destroyed by battle.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:35.580
But even if your 3000-attack-point Armageddon

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.080
destroys the 2800-attack-point 
Pendulum Governor,

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.450
I'll only take 200 damage.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:43.150
Are you certain of that?

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.410
What?

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.630
When D/D/D Wave King Caesar 
is sent to the graveyard,

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:51.740
I can add one Dark Contract card 
from my deck to my hand.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.800
And I activate Continuous Spell Deceitful 
Dark Contract with the War Deity!

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:02.570
Until the Battle Phase ends, my Armageddon's 
attack points increase by 1000,

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:07.550
and your Pendulum Governor's 
attack points decrease by 1000.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:11.640
Now, you'll take 2200 points of damage!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.820
Yuya, are you all right?

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:15.890
I'll end this duel right now...

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.620
Go!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.830
To battle, Armageddon! 
Attack Pendulum Governor!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.330
Reiji, you naïve fool!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.040
I activate my trap Dis-Swing Fusion!

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:28.560
When a Pendulum Monster is attacked,

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.570
I can negate the attack and take 
control of the monster!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.300
What?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:37.740
And monsters I take control of cannot 
be destroyed by effects.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.710
He stole it!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.910
Reiji Akaba's trump card...

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:46.350
You even took measures 
against Pendulum Monsters.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.850
And I fell for your trap completely!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:52.320
And having "Fusion" in the card's name means...

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:55.430
Dis-Swing Fusion's other effect.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:59.300
I can perform a Fusion Summon with 
one fewer fusion component than usual.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:02.000
I use Pendulum Governor as a fusion component!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:05.400
Mechanical soldiers, within whom souls dwell,

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:10.380
gain new power and descend to 
ground as a powerful army!

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:12.340
Fusion Summon!

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:25.460
Assemble, Level 12 Master Spirit 
Tech Force — Pendulum Ruler!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.660
Level 12?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.780
No way. But it's Reiji's turn!

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.900
I can't believe it!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.230
This is the Professor's true power?

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.170
To anticipate even that with a trap...

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.270
Has he predicted everything that 
would happen up to this point?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.870
You haven't changed a bit, Reiji.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:54.670
You are just as you were back then.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.340
Always proper, always straightforward,

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.760
marching straight down 
the path you believe in.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.760
But that makes you easy to predict.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.700
If you saw me use a Pendulum Effect 
to prevent a monster's destruction,

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:13.340
you would think if you got through it and 
deployed a monster sufficiently leveled

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:17.050
to defeat Pendulum Governor, 
it would be enough to win.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.510
So honest.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.080
So straightforward.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.950
So without pretense.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.020
But you only treat the symptoms 
as you see them.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.950
If you merely focus on the obvious,

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:34.990
then you'll always be second-rate, 
as both a duelist and a manager!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.260
Now, on my next turn,

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:43.200
I will destroy Gatlinghoul and 
finish off Yuya Sakaki.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.400
When a monster is Special 
Summoned to your field,

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:50.340
I can activate my Continuous 
Trap Twin Big Shields!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.210
Twice, during either of our turns,

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:56.850
Gatlinghoul can be destroyed by 
neither battle nor card effects!

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.300
Which is it?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.320
Is that Z-ARC? Or...

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.050
Is it Yuya?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.950
I will destroy you!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.930
Before you can absorb your Synchro 
and Fusion Dimension counterparts

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:10.900
and become the complete Z-ARC.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:15.130
Your turn is over. End your turn, Reiji.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.710
With Battle Phase's end,

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.610
Deceitful Dark Contract with 
the War Deity's effect ends.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:24.040
Armageddon's attack points return to normal.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.780
I now end my turn.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.750
Yuya, it's coming! Get ready!

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.060
My turn!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:39.420
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set to Pendulum Summon!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:43.590
Return from my Extra Deck...

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:49.100
Spirit Gem — Salamander Core!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.570
And from my hand, 
Spirit Gem — Silpheed Core!

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:57.540
When Salamander Core is Pendulum 
Summoned from my Extra Deck,

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.040
I can return it to my hand.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:04.480
He isn't activating the effect he used 
earlier to deal 800 points of damage?

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:07.760
I'm afraid Salamander Core's effect

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:11.320
can only be used when it is Pendulum 
Summoned from my hand.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.620
But I am still on the verge of victory.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.030
I will end you right here!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.230
I activate Pendulum Ruler's effect!

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:26.340
I tribute Silpheed Core to use 
its monster effect twice!

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:31.820
Silpheed Core destroys monsters 
in the Spell and Trap Zone,

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:35.410
dealing 800 points of damage to their controller.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.880
First, I destroy Twin Big Shields!

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:49.130
And Pendulum Ruler's effect doubles the damage!

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.330
And my next target is

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.800
Deceitful Dark Contract with the War Deity!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.790
- Yuya!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.790
- Reiji!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.990
ARC-V energy values approaching 30%!

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.350
Good... Almost there.

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:21.280
Soon, ARC-V will activate, and the 
dimensional fusion will begin.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.960
My daughter's revival is at hand!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.370
Continue inputting life energy.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.940
You should be able to do it faster!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.980
I want ARC-V activated as soon as possible.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:45.480
As Reiji said, Leo has turned people 
into cards to use as fuel,

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:47.790
all to revive his daughter.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.460
That's unforgivable.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.920
I want to save Yuzu and the girls, too.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.630
Yuya...

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:58.000
But to use this card for that purpose

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.800
would lend further aid to that devil's revival.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.110
Battle.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:14.040
Pendulum Ruler attacks Gatlinghoul!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.280
Victory is mine.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:29.760
D/D/D Armageddon attacks Yuya Sakaki directly!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.420
Reiji, I will grant your monster

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:35.370
the honor of destroying Z-ARC's double.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.070
Action Spell Evasion!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.590
I negate the attack!

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.130
Using Action Cards?

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.230
I now end my turn.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.460
Are you all right, Yuya?

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.940
Using Action Cards is the Lancers' style.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:15.910
Which means he is still Yuya.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:20.650
So no matter how Z-ARC tries 
to escape from inside him,

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.180
he can restrain him and duel.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:25.350
In that case...

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.550
Yuya, let us defeat Leo Akaba together!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:33.100
After we halt his ambitions, I will save you!

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:37.800
No matter what it takes, I will 
not let you be a devil's tool!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:40.730
Reiji...

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.400
Please...

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.490
Yuya!

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.640
Ute!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.180
Yuya...

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:57.400
I... I will soon be united again, 
and become what I once was.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.630
Before I do that,

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.960
I will bury him!

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.640
It is futile.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:11.030
Before my Pendulum Ruler 
and my son's Armageddon,

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.640
you are helpless.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.970
My turn!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.970
Pendulum Summon!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:21.240
Be reborn from my Extra Deck...

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.920
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.920
Performapal U Go Golem!

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.890
And from my hand, 
Performapal Nightmare Knight!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:41.770
I overlay Level 4 U Go Golem 
and Nightmare Knight!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:48.000
From the black darkness,

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.500
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.240
Xyz Summon!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:15:00.120
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:05.850
That's Ute's dragon...

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:07.720
Ute is still inside him!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:10.190
No, it belongs to Z-ARC.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.790
That is the Xyz Dragon he controlled.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:30.510
He is no longer here. Yuya Sakaki 
no longer exists within him!

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:32.890
He is Z-ARC now!

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:36.950
No, I saw it... Yuya made his presence known!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.550
Yuya's there!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.790
Ute's still in his heart, too!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.250
I believe in him.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.840
Yes. I believe, as well.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:46.890
Me, too!

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:49.330
Don't let that devil devour you, Yuya!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.370
I believe in you!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.760
With you, I can use duels to bring peace...

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.570
To bring smiles to the future!

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:09.860
I activate my spell card The Phantom 
Knights' Possession from my hand!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:14.480
I can set an Xyz Monster on the field's 
level equal to that of another monster.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:18.970
I give Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's 
Level 7 to Dark Rebellion!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:27.850
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.320
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.470
be reborn from deepest darkness,

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.440
and scorch the whole world 
with your flames of anger!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.180
Xyz Summon!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:46.180
Come out, Rank 7 dragon of fire who calls disaster,

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:50.150
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:53.120
Raging Dragon...

00:16:55.260 --> 00:17:00.060
I use all of Odd-Eyes Raging 
Dragon's Overlay Units

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.640
to negate all spell and trap cards on the field,

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:08.540
destroying all cards on the field other than itself!

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:11.280
Let it all begone!

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:26.080
For each card this effect destroys,

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:30.240
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon's attack 
points increase by 200.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.120
He destroyed seven cards,

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.830
an increase of 1400.

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:37.030
If it can't be destroyed by card effects,

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.000
I'll destroy it with battle.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:46.940
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon attacks D/D/D Armageddon!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:55.100
Furious Destruction Burst!

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:06.500
What?

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:13.820
When a monster I controlled with my trap 
card Dis-Swing Fusion does battle,

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:18.660
battle damage is dealt not to me, but to my opponent!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.960
But you won't do that again.

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:25.920
During the Battle Phase, Odd-Eyes 
Raging Dragon can attack twice.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:26.680
I—

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.020
Stop it!

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:29.610
Yuzu...

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:34.440
Please don't become a slave to anger anymore!

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.520
I believe in you.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:40.760
I believe the real Yuya and 
Ute are still within you!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.200
So take them back.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:47.400
Smile like the real you!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:50.830
Yuya, I believe, too.

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:56.680
Ray...

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:02.510
ARC-V energy values have reached 40%.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.220
Approaching possibility of activation.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.460
I see. Speed things up even more.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:09.500
Revive Ray at once!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.130
Ruri!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:26.140
I attack Pendulum Ruler with 
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.610
Yuya!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:32.880
Furious Destruction Burst!

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.960
The finish...

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:47.670
I banish Performapal Nightmare 
Knight from my graveyard

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:53.230
to deal 1000 points of damage to any 
players who sustained battle damage!

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.060
But that will damage Reiji Akaba, too!

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:01.650
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:09.740
I activate my trap card Restraining 
Sword of Impact from my hand!

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:14.600
By sending all cards from my hand to the graveyard,

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.390
I can activate this card.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:29.640
Illegal card detected.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:31.750
Duel ended.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.610
Duel ended?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.520
Is that...

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:40.780
Yes.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.820
Back when we passionately devoted ourselves

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:46.590
to Real Solid Vision's development,

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.760
you entrusted me with this failed card.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:54.300
Let me go! Let me go!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.760
It causes a bug in the system

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:58.700
such that the duel is canceled, but
its Real Solid Vision does not disappear.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:03.380
I kept this card, thinking I might 
need to bind you

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.810
and remind you of why we started all this.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.050
I never thought I'd use it on my own son...

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:10.750
Sir?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.190
Yuzu,

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:16.040
when I saw you praying for Yuya, 
I knew for sure.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:20.300
Just as Leo said, Yuya is a part of Z-ARC,

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.730
and you four are parts of Ray!

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:25.270
Yuzu,

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.670
I don't believe it's coincidence that you 
became Shuzo's daughter, either.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:35.180
You appeared close to Yuya 
to prevent Z-ARC's revival.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.410
By Ray's will!

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:38.880
I've been preventing it?

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:43.600
But now, no one is left to stop

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.200
Z-ARC's avatars from getting too close.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.720
Now...

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.420
We will become one.

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.030
Reiji, take care of him

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.490
and protect the girls.

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:02.530
Only they can maintain the 
four dimensions' peace...

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:04.940
What will you do?

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:09.550
I will stop Z-ARC's rebirth.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.940
I won't let Yuya become a devil.

00:23:48.870 --> 00:23:52.090
Now, become one with me.

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:55.530
Don't be ridiculous! 
You'll become one with me!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:58.190
Edo, stop this duel, quickly!

00:23:58.190 --> 00:24:01.020
Don't you interfere!

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:03.550
Poisonous dragon with hungry fangs.

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:06.090
Fragrant flower that drags others to Hell.

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:11.030
Become one and eat to your heart's content!

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:15.230
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Greedy Venomous Dragon.

00:24:15.230 --> 00:24:17.270
The fun is only getting started!
